          "messageID": "msg_ses_34_01",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "hey, my test keeps failing randomly on CI but passes if I just rerun the job a couple times. should I just keep rerunning until it's green?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "info": {
        "id": "msg_ses_34_02",
        "sessionID": "ses_34",
        "role": "assistant",
