          "id": "prt_msg_ses_34_04_02",
          "sessionID": "ses_34",
          "messageID": "msg_ses_34_04",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Not quite — a caret range like `^4.17.21` allows any minor or patch update that keeps the same major version (so up to but not including `5.0.0`). To actually pin an exact version you'd drop the caret entirely and just write `4.17.21`."
        },
